-- The hazard at its sharpest: the module the differential witness imports to
-- re-parse the source it is comparing. A search path that reached this file
-- would hand the gate a parser supplied by the very tree it is judging, and the
-- comparison would certify a parser against itself. It exports none of the names
-- the real parser exports, so that mistake is loud rather than quiet.

fn shadowed_parse() : Int = 0
